Revision history for Game-RoyalUr

0.03    2026-10-13
        - Add options, the fields a launcher offers before a game
        - The keys, the screen and the steering are Game::Terminal::Kit's
        - Shift-tab is named back_tab and the space bar is a space, as the kit names them
        - An unset NO_COLOR or an empty one leaves colour on; any other value turns it off
        - Add to_text and from_text, and a record carries the position a game started from
        - u takes back a turn and r plays it again, through Game::Terminal::Kit::History; the route moves to R

0.02    2026-10-11
        - Add Game::RoyalUr::Terminal->run(@argv), which returns the exit status

0.01    2026-10-09
        - First release.
